#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:5
msgid "Model Warmup"
msgstr "Model Warmup"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:9
msgid ""
"ModelWarmup is experimental. Its API and behavior may change in future "
"releases."
msgstr "ModelWarmup 是实验性功能，其 API 和行为在后续版本中可能发生变化。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:12
msgid ""
"``ModelWarmup`` supports a finite ``Once`` lifecycle and a long-lived "
"``Continuous`` lifecycle on selected Kubernetes nodes. A resource can be "
"image-only, custom-only, or combined: image entries make the runtime pull an "
"image and run a safe finite command; custom actions can check a node or "
"download an artifact; a combined action does both. It does not start an "
"inference engine or gate workloads."
msgstr ""
"``ModelWarmup`` 在选定的 Kubernetes 节点上支持有限的 ``Once`` 生命周期和长期"
"运行的 ``Continuous`` 生命周期。资源可以仅包含镜像、仅包含自定义操作，也可以"
"将二者组合：镜像条目会让容器运行时拉取镜像并运行一条可安全结束的命令；自定义"
"操作可以检查节点或下载制品；组合操作则同时完成这两项工作。它不会启动推理引"
"擎，也不会用作工作负载门禁。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:19
msgid ""
"ModelWarmup runs a node-pinned Job on each selected node to preload images "
"and download model artifacts"
msgstr ""
"ModelWarmup 在每个选中的节点上运行固定到该节点的 Job，预加载镜像并下载模型制"
"品"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:25
msgid "Workflow and data flow"
msgstr "工作流程与数据流"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:37
msgid ""
"Every target receives a node-pinned Job. Custom init containers run in their "
"declared order. Once they succeed, the controller-generated image containers "
"and ``custom.containers`` are regular containers and may run concurrently. "
"All of them must terminate successfully for that node Job to succeed. "
"``status`` remains an aggregate observation of the generated Jobs rather "
"than a separate per-container execution API."
msgstr ""
"每个目标都会收到一个固定到该节点的 Job。自定义 init 容器按声明顺序运行。它们"
"成功后，由控制器生成的镜像容器和 ``custom.containers`` 都作为普通容器运行，并"
"且可以并发执行。只有所有容器都成功终止，该节点的 Job 才会成功。``status`` 仍"
"是对已生成 Job 的聚合观测，而不是独立的逐容器执行 API。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:47
msgid "Targeting and execution"
msgstr "目标选择与执行"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:49
msgid ""
"Targets can combine explicit node names and non-empty label selectors. The "
"controller takes their union and deduplicates nodes. While a ``Once`` "
"operation is not terminal, Node create and label events add newly matched "
"nodes. After Succeeded, Failed, or Degraded, later nodes are ignored."
msgstr ""
"目标可以同时使用显式节点名称和非空标签选择器。控制器会取二者的并集并对节点去"
"重。在 ``Once`` 操作尚未进入终态时，Node 创建和标签事件会加入新匹配的节点。进"
"入 Succeeded、Failed 或 Degraded 状态后，后续节点将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:54
msgid ""
"``Continuous`` keeps reconciling the current authorized target set. A newly "
"matching Node receives a Job, while a Node that leaves the selector or "
"authorization boundary has its owned Job removed. Coverage is identified by "
"the Node UID, so a replacement Node with the same name is warmed again. A "
"Node that leaves and later rejoins also starts a new coverage cycle."
msgstr ""
"``Continuous`` 会持续协调当前已授权的目标集合。新匹配的 Node 会获得一个 Job；"
"当 Node 离开选择器范围或授权边界时，其所属 Job 会被删除。覆盖记录通过 Node "
"UID 标识，因此名称相同的替换 Node 仍会重新预热。Node 离开后再次加入时，也会启"
"动新的覆盖周期。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:60
msgid ""
"The namespace and target nodes must share the ``resource-pool.aibrix.ai/"
"name`` label, and nodes must opt in with ``model.aibrix.ai/warmup-"
"enabled=true``. Control-plane nodes are excluded. ``parallelism`` limits "
"simultaneously active Jobs, and ``jobTimeoutSeconds`` applies after a Job is "
"created. ``retryLimit`` and ``ttlSecondsAfterFinished`` bound retry and "
"retention behavior."
msgstr ""
"命名空间和目标节点必须具有相同的 ``resource-pool.aibrix.ai/name`` 标签，并且"
"节点必须通过 ``model.aibrix.ai/warmup-enabled=true`` 明确加入。控制平面节点会"
"被排除。``parallelism`` 限制同时处于活跃状态的 Job 数量，"
"``jobTimeoutSeconds`` 从 Job 创建后开始生效。``retryLimit`` 和 "
"``ttlSecondsAfterFinished`` 分别约束重试和保留行为。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:67
msgid ""
"This authorization applies to both lifecycle modes. If the Namespace has no "
"non-empty resource-pool label, matching Nodes are not authorized. ``Once`` "
"reports unavailable or unauthorized configured targets and does not reopen "
"after reaching a terminal phase. ``Continuous`` remains ``Pending`` with "
"``Ready=False`` and reason ``NamespacePoolNotConfigured``; after the label "
"is added or corrected, it automatically resolves the current targets. If "
"Nodes exist but their names, pool labels, or warmup opt-in do not authorize "
"them, the Continuous Ready condition uses "
"``TargetsUnavailableOrUnauthorized``. Inspect both sides of the "
"authorization boundary with:"
msgstr ""
"此授权规则同时适用于两种生命周期模式。如果 Namespace 没有非空的资源池标签，匹"
"配的 Node 不会获得授权。``Once`` 会报告不可用或未授权的已配置目标，并且进入终"
"态后不会重新打开。``Continuous`` 会保持 ``Pending``，其 ``Ready=False`` "
"condition 的 reason 为 ``NamespacePoolNotConfigured``；添加或修正标签后，它会"
"自动重新解析当前目标。如果 Node 存在，但名称、资源池标签或 warmup 显式启用设"
"置未能授权这些 Node，Continuous 的 Ready condition 会使用 "
"``TargetsUnavailableOrUnauthorized``。可以使用以下命令检查授权边界两侧："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:82
msgid ""
"Continuous aggregate status covers only the currently resolved and "
"authorized set. If some explicit names are missing or unauthorized while "
"other targets resolve, those names are excluded from ``desiredNodes`` and do "
"not prevent ``Ready``; this differs from Once, which reports them as failed "
"targets. Verify explicit names and authorization labels when the reported "
"desired count is lower than the configured list."
msgstr ""
"Continuous 聚合状态只覆盖当前已解析且已授权的集合。如果部分显式名称缺失或未获"
"授权，而其他目标能够解析，这些名称会从 ``desiredNodes`` 中排除，也不会阻止进"
"入 ``Ready``；这与 Once 不同，Once 会将它们报告为失败目标。当报告的目标数量小"
"于配置列表时，请检查显式名称和授权标签。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:89
msgid ""
"For ``Continuous``, ``retryLimit`` still controls retries inside one "
"Kubernetes Job. ``continuousRetryLimit`` controls the number of additional "
"Jobs after a terminal failure, and ``continuousRetryIntervalSeconds`` "
"controls the fixed delay between those attempts, from 1 second through "
"604800 seconds (7 days). Automatic retries stop after that budget is "
"exhausted. Deleting the retained failed Job explicitly starts a new bounded "
"retry cycle."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``Continuous``，``retryLimit`` 仍控制单个 Kubernetes Job 内部的重试。"
"``continuousRetryLimit`` 控制终态失败后允许创建的额外 Job 数量，"
"``continuousRetryIntervalSeconds`` 控制这些尝试之间的固定间隔，范围为 1 秒到 "
"604800 秒（7 天）。重试预算耗尽后会停止自动重试。显式删除保留的失败 Job 会启"
"动一个新的有限重试周期。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:96
msgid ""
"Successful Continuous Jobs are retained as the per-Node coverage record and "
"must not use ``ttlSecondsAfterFinished``. Deleting a retained successful Job "
"requests a replay. ``Ready`` means all current targets have succeeded; "
"``lastConvergedTime`` records the most recent transition into Ready, and "
"``completionTime`` remains unset. Pending, running, and failed target "
"details remain bounded even when aggregate counters cover a larger target "
"set. Each current target retains one Job and its completed Pod, so a 1,000-"
"Node Continuous warmup can hold roughly 1,000 Jobs and 1,000 Pods and may "
"consume namespace object or Pod quotas."
msgstr ""
"成功的 Continuous Job 会作为逐 Node 覆盖记录保留，并且不能使用 "
"``ttlSecondsAfterFinished``。删除保留的成功 Job 表示请求重新执行。``Ready`` "
"表示所有当前目标均已成功；``lastConvergedTime`` 记录最近一次进入 Ready 的时"
"间，而 ``completionTime`` 始终不设置。即使聚合计数覆盖更大的目标集合，"
"pending、running 和 failed 目标详情仍保持有界。每个当前目标会保留一个 Job 及"
"其已完成的 Pod，因此包含 1,000 个 Node 的 Continuous 预热大约会保留 1,000 个 "
"Job 和 1,000 个 Pod，并可能占用 Namespace 的对象或 Pod 配额。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:106
msgid ""
"ModelWarmup does not infer tolerations from the target Node. A Node with a "
"``NoSchedule`` or ``NoExecute`` taint remains subject to normal Kubernetes "
"scheduling policy. Image-only actions request no GPU, while a custom "
"container can explicitly request a device such as ``nvidia.com/gpu``."
msgstr ""
"ModelWarmup 不会根据目标 Node 推断容忍度。带有 ``NoSchedule`` 或 "
"``NoExecute`` 污点的 Node 仍遵循常规 Kubernetes 调度策略。仅镜像操作不会请求 "
"GPU，而自定义容器可以显式请求 ``nvidia.com/gpu`` 等设备。"

