"GiB 可用内存，并检查 Hugging Face DNS："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:187
msgid ""
"The examples preload pinned vLLM or SGLang images while the custom regular "
"container downloads the model into a separate node-local cache. Restrict the "
"selector to the intended nodes; two nodes are sufficient for a smoke test. "
"They prepare caches only and do not start an inference server. See the "
"sample directory README for apply commands and prerequisites."
msgstr ""
"这些示例会预加载固定版本的 vLLM 或 SGLang 镜像，同时由自定义普通容器将模型下"
"载到单独的节点本地缓存。请将选择器限制在预期节点范围内；冒烟测试使用两个节点"
"即可。它们只准备缓存，不会启动推理服务器。应用命令和前提条件请参阅示例目录中"
"的 README。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:326
msgid "Security and cache durability"
msgstr "安全性与缓存持久性"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:328
msgid ""
"The namespace-to-node resource-pool label plus explicit node opt-in form the "
"scheduling authorization boundary. They do not make arbitrary custom actions "
"safe. Custom actions receive exactly the volumes, images, and resource "
"requests declared in the resource, so creation permission is sensitive. Use "
"least-privilege RBAC and dedicated target pools; restrict who can create "
"ModelWarmups that use ``hostPath`` or privileged settings."
msgstr ""
"命名空间与节点之间的资源池标签，加上节点的显式加入，共同构成调度授权边界。但"
"这些机制并不能保证任意自定义操作都是安全的。自定义操作会获得资源中声明的全部"
"卷、镜像和资源请求，因此创建权限十分敏感。请使用最小权限 RBAC 和专用目标池，"
"并限制哪些主体可以创建使用 ``hostPath`` 或特权设置的 ModelWarmup。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:335
msgid ""
"Automatic service-account token mounting is disabled, but explicit projected "
"``serviceAccountToken`` volumes are allowed and use the Pod's service "
"account permissions (normally the namespace default service account). Secret "
"volumes can also expose namespace credentials. Keep service-account "
"permissions minimal and restrict which token and secret volumes ModelWarmup "
"authors may request."
msgstr ""
"自动挂载服务账户令牌已禁用，但允许显式投射的 ``serviceAccountToken`` 卷，并会"
"使用 Pod 的服务账户权限（通常是命名空间的默认服务账户）。Secret 卷也可能暴露"
"命名空间凭据。请尽量缩减服务账户权限，并限制 ModelWarmup 创建者可以请求哪些令"
"牌卷和 Secret 卷。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:341
msgid ""
"ModelWarmup admission does not perform full native Job/Pod validation. If "
"the API server rejects Job creation, the controller logs the error and "
"requeues it. With no Job to inspect, bounded Job diagnostics and ModelWarmup "
"failure status may not record that rejection; check controller logs when "
"progress stalls."
msgstr ""
"ModelWarmup 准入不会执行完整的原生 Job/Pod 校验。如果 API server 拒绝创建 "
"Job，控制器会记录错误并将其重新入队。由于没有可供检查的 Job，有界 Job 诊断和 "
"ModelWarmup 失败状态可能不会记录该拒绝；进度停滞时请检查控制器日志。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:346
msgid ""
"A Job can also be accepted while admission rejects every Pod that it tries to "
"create. For example, a namespace enforcing the ``restricted`` Pod Security "
"standard can reject an image-only warmup because its generated containers do "
"not set every required security-context field. The Job then has no Pods, and "
"the target can report ``Running`` until ``jobTimeoutSeconds`` expires. Inspect "
"the Job and its ``FailedCreate`` events to find the admission message:"
msgstr ""
"Job 也可能已被接受，而准入控制却拒绝它尝试创建的每个 Pod。例如，强制执行 "
"``restricted`` Pod Security 标准的命名空间可能会拒绝仅镜像预热，因为其生成"
"的容器未设置所有必需的安全上下文字段。此时 Job 没有 Pod，而目标可能会持续报告 "
"``Running``，直到 ``jobTimeoutSeconds`` 到期。检查该 Job 及其 "
"``FailedCreate`` 事件以查找准入错误消息："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:359
msgid ""
"Use ``spec.custom.containers`` when the action needs an explicit "
"``securityContext`` that satisfies namespace policy. Image-only entries do "
"not expose that field. Alternatively, run the warmup in a namespace whose "
"admission policy permits the generated Pod template."
msgstr ""
"当操作需要满足命名空间策略的显式 ``securityContext`` 时，请使用 "
"``spec.custom.containers``。仅镜像条目不提供该字段。或者，也可以在准入策略"
"允许所生成 Pod 模板的命名空间中运行预热。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:364
msgid ""
"The bundled cache samples use ``hostPath`` at ``/var/lib/aibrix/models`` "
"with ``DirectoryOrCreate``. That exposes a node filesystem path to the Job "
"and may be disallowed by Pod Security admission. The samples do not require "
"privileged containers; do not broaden privilege, host networking, PID "
"namespaces, or host mount scope solely to run them."
msgstr ""
"随附的缓存示例在 ``/var/lib/aibrix/models`` 路径使用类型为 "
"``DirectoryOrCreate`` 的 ``hostPath``。这会向 Job 暴露节点文件系统路径，可能"
"被 Pod Security 准入禁止。示例不需要特权容器；请勿仅为运行这些示例而扩大特"
"权、主机网络、PID 命名空间或主机挂载范围。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:370
msgid ""
"``Succeeded`` and ``Ready`` are point-in-time aggregate Job results. Kubelet "
"or runtime image garbage collection can evict pulled images, and node "
"replacement, cleanup, or storage failures can remove host-path model "
"artifacts. Use immutable image and model references when reproducibility "
"matters, and retain a durable artifact source for production workloads."
msgstr ""
"``Succeeded`` 和 ``Ready`` 是某一时点的聚合 Job 结果。Kubelet 或容器运行时的"
"镜像垃圾回收可能清除已拉取的镜像，而节点替换、清理或存储故障可能移除主机路径"
"中的模型制品。需要可重现性时，请使用不可变的镜像和模型引用，并为生产工作负载"
"保留持久的制品来源。"

