#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:416
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:418
msgid ""
"The spec is immutable after creation; create another resource to change an "
"action, selector, or lifecycle policy. Separate pipeline stages, arbitrary "
"lifecycle hooks, workload or rollout gating, autoscaler mutation, and "
"workload-derived targets remain out of scope. Custom actions are finite Job "
"work, not a general-purpose deployment or orchestration framework. Deleting "
"and recreating a Continuous resource deletes its owned coverage ledger and "
"warms every currently authorized target again."
msgstr ""
"spec 创建后不可变；如需更改操作、选择器或生命周期策略，请创建新的资源。独立的"
"流水线阶段、任意生命周期钩子、工作负载或发布门禁、自动扩缩容器变更，以及从工"
"作负载派生目标，仍不在支持范围内。自定义操作是有限的 Job 工作，而非通用部署或"
"编排框架。删除并重新创建 Continuous 资源会删除其所属的覆盖 ledger，并重新预热"
"所有当前已授权目标。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:196
msgid "Prepare model caches for ModelClaim"
msgstr "为 ModelClaim 准备模型缓存"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:198
msgid ""
"Use ``aibrix_download --prepare-cache`` in a custom action to prepare files "
"for an unchanged :ref:`ModelClaim <modelclaim>`. Download metadata is a "
"general capability of the existing downloader, not a separate Warmup "
"service. With ``AIBRIX_MODEL_CACHE_METADATA_DIR`` configured, ordinary "
"successful AIBrix downloads also register their results while still "
"returning the original path. Metadata publication is best-effort for "
"ordinary downloads; explicit cache preparation requires it to succeed."
msgstr ""
"在自定义操作中使用 ``aibrix_download --prepare-cache``，为无需修改的 :ref:`ModelClaim "
"<modelclaim>` 准备文件。下载 metadata 是现有 downloader 的通用能力，而不是独立的 Warmup 服务。配置 "
"``AIBRIX_MODEL_CACHE_METADATA_DIR`` 后，普通 AIBrix "
"下载成功时也会登记结果，并继续返回原来的路径。普通下载会尽力发布 metadata；显式缓存准备则要求发布成功。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:206
msgid ""
"The runtime reads this shared metadata, checks registered files locally, and"
" reports URL hints through its existing ``cached_artifacts`` snapshot field."
" The controller can then prefer a cached warm Pod among candidates that "
"satisfy its existing capacity and pool constraints. ModelWarmup success "
"alone does not mean a model is ready to serve, and metadata does not replace"
" the loader's remote freshness checks."
msgstr ""
"runtime 读取共享 metadata，在本地检查已登记文件，并通过现有 snapshot 的 ``cached_artifacts`` 字段上报 "
"URL 提示。控制器随后可以在满足现有容量和资源池约束的候选者中，优先选择有缓存的 warm Pod。ModelWarmup "
"成功本身不表示模型已可提供服务，metadata 也不会替代加载器对远端文件是否更新的检查。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:214
msgid "Connect an existing warm pool"
msgstr "关联现有 warm pool"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:216
msgid ""
"Use preparation and runtime images that include this capability. Keep the "
"pool's existing cache settings, mounts, credentials, and endpoint "
"configuration. The only new environment variable needed to enable "
"registration and discovery is ``AIBRIX_MODEL_CACHE_METADATA_DIR``. Point it "
"at a writable directory shared by the preparation Job and the runtime on the"
" same node."
msgstr ""
"使用包含此能力的准备镜像和 runtime 镜像。保留池中已有的缓存设置、挂载、凭据和 endpoint 配置。启用登记和发现只需新增环境变量 "
"``AIBRIX_MODEL_CACHE_METADATA_DIR``，将其指向同一节点上准备 Job 与 runtime 共享的可写目录。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:222
msgid ""
"For the existing HF warm-pool sample, reuse its ``hf-cache`` volume and add:"
msgstr "对于现有 HF warm-pool 示例，复用其 ``hf-cache`` 卷并添加："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:229
msgid ""
"This path uses the sample's existing node directory "
"``/var/cache/aibrix/huggingface``. Do not add or override ``HF_HUB_CACHE`` "
"or ``DOWNLOADER_LOCAL_DIR``, or add unused backend volumes, merely to enable"
" metadata. If the pool already has nondefault cache settings, make the Job "
"use those settings and the same underlying files. Apply environment changes "
"through the pool's normal rollout procedure; running Pods do not pick them "
"up without replacement."
msgstr ""
"此路径使用示例中已有的节点目录 ``/var/cache/aibrix/huggingface``。不要仅为启用 metadata 而新增或覆盖 "
"``HF_HUB_CACHE``、``DOWNLOADER_LOCAL_DIR``，也不要添加未使用的后端卷。如果池中已使用非默认缓存设置，应让 Job"
" 采用这些设置并访问同一份底层文件。通过池的常规发布流程使环境变量变更生效；正在运行的 Pod 不会在不被替换的情况下自动获得这些变更。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:237
msgid ""
"Reuse the namespace/node authorization described in :ref:`model-warmup-"
"targeting`. Prepare on the authorized worker nodes that host eligible warm "
"Pods. Nodes in the same resource pool do not automatically share files. A "
"container-local cache must be made accessible to both Pods before cross-Pod "
"reuse can work; sharing metadata alone does not share model weights."
msgstr ""
"复用 :ref:`model-warmup-targeting` 一节介绍的 namespace/node 授权。在承载合格 warm Pod 的已授权"
" worker 节点上执行准备。同一资源池的节点不会自动共享文件。要实现跨 Pod 复用，必须让两个 Pod 都能访问原本位于容器内的缓存；仅共享 "
"metadata 不会共享模型权重。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:244
msgid "Run preparation and verify discovery"
msgstr "执行准备并验证发现结果"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:246
msgid ""
"The following example uses the existing HF cache mount. Build and distribute"
" the referenced preparation image from a source version containing this "
"feature, and use a matching runtime version in the warm pool:"
msgstr ""
"下例使用已有的 HF 缓存挂载。请从包含此特性的源码版本构建并分发所引用的准备镜像，同时在 warm pool 中使用匹配的 runtime 版本："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:254
msgid "Apply the sample and wait for its finite preparation Job to complete:"
msgstr "应用示例并等待有限生命周期的准备 Job 完成："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:262
msgid ""
"Discovery is asynchronous and normally refreshes every 10 seconds. Before "
"expecting cache-aware placement, read the runtime snapshot and check that "
"``cached_artifacts`` contains the exact model URL used by the Claim:"
msgstr ""
"发现过程是异步的，通常每 10 秒刷新一次。在期望缓存感知放置生效之前，读取 runtime snapshot，确认 "
"``cached_artifacts`` 包含 Claim 使用的精确模型 URL："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:271
msgid ""
"Once the URL is reported, apply the original Claim without adding a Warmup "
"reference, local path, or revision field:"
msgstr "URL 上报后，应用原来的 Claim，无需新增 Warmup 引用、本地路径或 revision 字段："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:279
msgid ""
"The preparation sample covers ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``. The two-model Claim "
"sample also requests ``Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct``; prepare that model "
"separately if you want both models cached ahead of demand. Otherwise it "
"follows the normal on-demand loading path. A cache hint never bypasses "
"insufficient GPU capacity."
msgstr ""
"准备示例覆盖 ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``。包含两个模型的 Claim 示例还会请求 "
"``Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct``；如果希望提前缓存两个模型，需要单独准备后者，否则它会走正常的按需加载路径。缓存提示绝不会绕过"
" GPU 容量不足的约束。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:285
msgid "Other sources and behavior"
msgstr "其他来源及行为"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:287
msgid ""
"The same command supports all existing downloader backends. Keep the "
"matching cache and metadata directories available to both preparation and "
"consumption:"
msgstr "同一命令支持现有的所有 downloader 后端。应让准备方和消费方都能访问匹配的缓存与 metadata 目录："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:297
msgid ""
"HF also accepts ``hf://`` and bare repository IDs; GCS also accepts "
"``gs://``. HF preparation uses the existing Hub client in native cache mode."
" S3, TOS, and GCS retain their existing downloader destinations and "
"ETag/size checks, so their normal source credentials and metadata requests "
"remain necessary. This feature does not promise offline loading. ``--local-"
"dir`` overrides only the producer's root; it must agree with the runtime's "
"existing effective cache location."
msgstr ""
"HF 也接受 ``hf://`` 和不带前缀的仓库 ID，GCS 也接受 ``gs://``。HF 准备使用现有 Hub "
"客户端的原生缓存模式。S3、TOS 和 GCS 保留已有的下载目标目录及 ETag/大小检查，因此仍需要原有的源凭据和 metadata "
"请求。此特性不保证离线加载。``--local-dir`` 仅覆盖准备方的根目录，必须与 runtime 当前实际使用的缓存位置一致。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:304
msgid ""
"``--prepare-cache`` requires an unfiltered source and a configured metadata "
"directory. Ordinary downloads with suffix filters remain supported, but "
"their records are not advertised as complete caches. No user-supplied commit"
" SHA is required. Nondefault HF revisions can be recorded, but only a "
"snapshot selected by the local ``refs/main`` is advertised as a default repo"
" hint. Cache hints do not freeze upstream references or provide exact-"
"version scheduling."
msgstr ""
"``--prepare-cache`` 要求使用未经过滤的源，并配置 metadata "
"目录。普通下载仍支持后缀过滤，但其记录不会被上报为完整缓存。用户无需提供 commit SHA。非默认 HF revision 可以被记录，但只有本地 "
"``refs/main`` 选中的 snapshot 才会上报为默认 repo 提示。缓存提示不会冻结上游引用，也不提供精确版本调度。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:311
msgid ""
"Metadata describes the current download's files using cache-relative paths "
"and file fingerprints. It does not infer a model family or prove engine "
"compatibility or cryptographic integrity. Missing or changed registered "
"files withdraw new hints; ordinary loading keeps its existing behavior. "
"Metadata is not a weight copy, and deleting a Claim or Warmup does not "
"delete the shared files."
msgstr ""
"metadata "
"使用相对于缓存根目录的路径和文件指纹描述本次下载的文件。它不推断模型家族，也不证明引擎兼容性或密码学完整性。已登记文件缺失或变化时会撤回新的提示，普通加载仍沿用既有行为。metadata"
" 不是权重副本，删除 Claim 或 Warmup 也不会删除共享文件。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/model-warmup.rst:317
msgid ""
"If no new hint appears, check the Job result and runtime logs, the effective"
" metadata directory and cache mounts in both Pods, file permissions, and "
"matching source settings. A disabled metadata variable preserves historical "
"download behavior. Runtime discovery reads registered results rather than "
"inventorying unregistered HF caches; legacy served markers remain "
"compatible. HF downloads performed directly inside an engine do not pass "
"through the AIBrix registration hook."
msgstr ""
"如果没有出现新提示，请检查 Job 结果和 runtime 日志、两个 Pod 中实际生效的 metadata "
"目录与缓存挂载、文件权限，以及源配置是否匹配。不启用 metadata 变量时保留原来的下载行为。runtime "
"发现读取的是已登记结果，不会遍历未登记的 HF 缓存；旧的 served marker 保持兼容。引擎内部直接执行的 HF 下载不会经过 AIBrix "
"的登记入口。"
